    <briefdescription>
<para>Abstract sink for network observability events. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Register a concrete implementation via <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1network_1_1_network_observability_registry_1a6fbc88c76958735190ea0778e9b071f7" kindref="member">NetworkObservabilityRegistry::setSink()</ref></computeroutput>. The default (null) sink discards all events.</para>
<para>Implementations MUST be thread-safe: <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1network_1_1_i_network_observability_sink_1accba7c0df9b379751187a0943542e5f2" kindref="member">onSpan()</ref></computeroutput> may be called from multiple threads concurrently. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
